# Dress Down is on the battlefield before Lumen-Class Frigate enters. Dress Down takes only creatures' abilities: with six
# charge counters the Frigate is not a creature, so "2+ | Other creatures you control get +1/+1" makes the second
# Dreadmaw a 7/7, and it stations seven more. Thirteen turn on "12+ | Flying, lifelink": one static ability whose effect
# began in layer 4, so its layer 6 and 7b parts keep applying although Dress Down, earlier in layer 6, took the
# now-creature Frigate's abilities - a 3/5 with flying and lifelink (CR 613.6, 721.2b). The 2+ striation is a separate
# static ability that Dress Down took, so the Dreadmaws are 6/6 again.

